  ["Looking for a brown tabby cat named \"Furball\" with patterns all over and petal-shaped spots on its back \n\n If there are clues, please send to <Mark id=\"#159\"> 35 Howls Street </> \n \n Clue Reward: <Letter_Highlight_HW> 1 Pound </> \n Retrieval Reward: <Letter_Highlight_HW> 10 Pounds </>"] = "Procurando por um gato malhado marrom chamado \"Furball\" com padrões por toda parte e manchas em forma de pétala nas costas \n\n Se houver pistas, envie para <Mark id=\"#159\"> 35 Howls Street </> \n \n Recompensa por pista: <Letter_Highlight_HW> 1 libra </> \n Recompensa de recuperação: <Letter_Highlight_HW> 10 libras </>",
