  ["The Giant Dragon brings the fire of disaster, watch out and dodge!"] = "O Dragão Gigante traz o fogo do desastre, cuidado e esquive-se!",
  ["The dragon flaps its wings and roars. <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\"> [%s] </> killed the president of <Chat_Highlight> %s club </>, <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\"> [%s] </>. This battle will be sung by bards."] = "O dragão bate as asas e ruge. <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\"> [ %s ] </> matou o presidente do <Chat_Highlight> %s clube </> , <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\"> [ %s ] </> . Esta batalha será cantada por bardos.",
