  ["Mr. Barney continuously shocks the ground and gains high <img id=\"09\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\"/> Damage Reduction."] = "Sr. Barney choca continuamente o solo e ganha alta <img id=\"09\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\"/> Redução de Dano.",
