  ["Afraid she'll refuse. Afraid I'll say the wrong thing. Afraid she'll laugh at me. Afraid... afraid of everything."] = "Com medo que ela recuse. Com medo de dizer a coisa errada. Com medo que ela ria de mim. Com medo... com medo de tudo.",
